ee to test and explore the features provided by the SAP Forms service.For more information, see SAP Forms Service by Adobe (SAP Discovery Center).\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-01-01\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3328 ---\nComponent: HTML5 Applications\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma\nTitle: Security Recommendations\nDescription: Security recommendations for the the application router have been published.   See SAP BTP Security Recommendations.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-07\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3329 ---\nComponent: Kyma Runtime\nEnvironment: Kyma\nTitle: SAP BTP Operator becomes a default module\nDescription: SAP BTP Operator has been upgraded to a default Kyma module and is now automatically added to all new clusters. This enhancement ensures that Service Management is readily available. For more information, read the Kyma Modules document.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-07\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 3330 ---\nComponent: Object Store\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry,Kyma\nTitle: Azure: A new approach for auto-expiration rules deletion\nDescription: A new approach to delete an auto-expiration rule has been introduced. Please refer Auto Expiration of Blobs and Blob Versions for more details.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-03-07\nValid as Of: 2024-03-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n\",648\n116,\"--- Record 3731 ---\nComponent: SAP Build Process Automation\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Forms Guided Tour\nDescription: Take a quick tour and see how to create a basic form.  You start the tour from your project Overview page using the  (question mark)